# Plan before implement

Before writing implementation code for a feature, fix, or multi-file change, **create or update a plan** and wait for confirmation (unless the user explicitly says to skip the plan).

Follow skill: [`.cursor/skills/plan-before-implement/SKILL.md`](../skills/plan-before-implement/SKILL.md).

**Skip only:** pure typos, one-line refactors, formatting-only. When unsure, plan first.
